T01 is Dimension / Current state / Evidence/baseline / Root cause / Impact / Confidence H/M/L, seeded with six dimensions. T02 adds target date and leading indicator. T03 has six columns and T04 seven (generated D-NN codes, Open by default).
The D-071 diff touches only apps/api/src/main.ts, evidence/routes.ts (an aborted-body 400 mapping), platform connection-hygiene/framework-errors/hooks/index, server.ts (requestTimeout, forceCloseConnections 'idle', the not-found handler registered after the rate limiter), API tests, ADR-0007 §5b and the ops docs. Zero files changed under apps/web, packages or docs/source. No methodology, gate criterion, sequence, register column, i18n string or UI changed. The SPA fallback still serves deep links (DOM-R11-08).

